 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. COMBAT-KNOCKBACK-HIT.
*> USING victim player row, attacker player row, extra knockback K (thousandths, 0 none), sprint: the knockback of a fresh hit (17 section 4.6): the
*> default 0.4 away from the attacker, then K along the attacker's facing; the velocity before is taken as 0 (the core keeps no player velocity); the
*> victim is sent the resulting Set Entity Motion.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 01 WS-STRENGTH            BINARY-LONG VALUE 400.
 01 WS-RESIST              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DX                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DZ                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-VX                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-VY                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-VZ                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-NX                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NY                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NZ                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-GROUND              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-RAD                 FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-PI                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 3.14159265358979.
 01 WS-ARMOR               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TOUGH               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PROT                BINARY-LONG.
 COPY ENCHCTX.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-VICTIM               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-ATTACKER             BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-K                    BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-VICTIM L-ATTACKER L-K.
     MOVE 0 TO WS-VX WS-VY WS-VZ
     MOVE PL-ON-GROUND(L-VICTIM) TO WS-GROUND
     MOVE 0 TO EC-DIRECT
     MOVE SPACES TO EC-DAMAGE-KEY EC-VICTIM-KEY
     MOVE -1 TO EC-VICTIM-ID
     CALL "COMBAT-ARMOR-STATS" USING L-VICTIM ENCH-CTX WS-ARMOR WS-TOUGH WS-RESIST WS-PROT
     COMPUTE WS-DX ROUNDED = (PL-X(L-ATTACKER) - PL-X(L-VICTIM)) * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-DZ ROUNDED = (PL-Z(L-ATTACKER) - PL-Z(L-VICTIM)) * 1000
     CALL "TOOL-KNOCKBACK" USING WS-STRENGTH WS-RESIST WS-DX WS-DZ WS-VX WS-VY WS-VZ WS-GROUND WS-NX WS-NY WS-NZ WS-STATUS
     MOVE WS-NX TO WS-VX
     MOVE WS-NY TO WS-VY
     MOVE WS-NZ TO WS-VZ
     IF L-K > 0
         MOVE PL-YAW(L-ATTACKER) TO WS-YAW
         COMPUTE WS-RAD = WS-YAW * WS-PI / 180
         COMPUTE WS-DX ROUNDED = FUNCTION SIN(WS-RAD) * 1000
         COMPUTE WS-DZ ROUNDED = 0 - FUNCTION COS(WS-RAD) * 1000
         CALL "TOOL-KNOCKBACK" USING L-K WS-RESIST WS-DX WS-DZ WS-VX WS-VY WS-VZ WS-GROUND WS-NX WS-NY WS-NZ WS-STATUS
         MOVE WS-NX TO WS-VX
         MOVE WS-NY TO WS-VY
         MOVE WS-NZ TO WS-VZ
     END-IF
     CALL "COMBAT-MOTION-SEND" USING L-VICTIM WS-VX WS-VY WS-VZ
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM COMBAT-KNOCKBACK-HIT.

